Q: Prisma 7 in Monorepo:“url is no longer supported in schema files”+“client engine requires adapter or accelerateUrl” — How to setup Classic Prisma ORM? A: <ol>
<li><p>In the root directory create a file called prisma.config.ts.</p>
</li>
<li><p>Put this into it:</p>
<pre><code>import &quot;dotenv/config&quot;
import { defineConfig,env } from &quot;@prisma/config&quot;;
export default defineConfig({
    schema: &quot;prisma/schema.prisma&quot;,
    datasource:{
        url : env(&quot;DATABASE_URL&quot;)
    }
})
</code></pre>
<p>You need to install Dotenv and @prisma/config if you don't have one.</p>
</li>
<li><p>In the prisma.schema file add <code>output = &quot;../src/generated/prisma</code>  in the generator client object.</p>
</li>
<li><p>Then do <code>npx prisma generate</code>.</p>
</li>
</ol>

Q: Cannot add a new element to rows returned by CodeIgniter&#39;s result() method A: <p>I found the error, I use $tmpICMS = $this->db->get()->result();
And this return a object, so I can't manipulate this like a Array, so i just need to change for $tmpICMS = $this->db->get()->result_array();
So this work for me</p>
